{
  "title": "Amazingly Velvety Syrian Cheese Kebabs",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Syrian dish featuring cream cheese, peppery and velvety, perfect for a whole30-friendly meal. This dish is grilled to perfection on a robata-grill.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
  "diet": [
